meta {
  name: Review Version
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/versions/{{version_id}}/review
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-User-ID: {{user_id}}
}

docs {
  Manually transition a version to IN_REVIEW status.
  
  Authorization:
  - User must have approval roles (admin, architect, or engineer)
  - Product and viewer roles cannot review
  
  State Transitions:
  - Version must be in SUBMITTED state
  - Transitions to IN_REVIEW status
  
  Use Cases:
  - Team lead signals "ready for approval" without approving themselves
  - Trigger notifications to approvers that version is ready
  - Explicitly start the review phase
  
  Note: This endpoint is OPTIONAL
  - First approval will auto-transition SUBMITTED → IN_REVIEW
  - Manual review is only needed if you want explicit control over when review starts
  - Useful for audit trails showing who initiated review vs who approved
}
